Vortex Ring State
The previous chapter provided a basic knowledge about the helicopter functioning and the way to control it. It has been shown that the blades of the rotor can either be controlled collectively or cyclically and that the helicopter can enter different configurations of axial descent with one being quite interesting : the Vortex Ring State. Finally, chapter 1 emphasized the inefficiency of the momentum theory to predict performances of the helicopter in this state.
