The simulation begins by a hover at a collective pitch of θ0 = 5◦ until to reach 1 second of simulation. Then, reduction of the blades angle of attack is initiated through collective command. The geometric angle of attack is decreased of 0.4◦ every 2.5 seconds of simulation. This decrease induces a descent velocity which causes the rotor to fall in the box. The velocity is computed based on the difference of the thrust measured by the VPM code and the thrust evaluated in the hover configuration.
